2026-07-27T12:24:21.4814225Z i /tmp/RtmpkmExki/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4814612Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4815071Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4815483Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4816128Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4817079Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:24:21.4818153Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
